        "field_path": [
          "study_summary_A",
          "problem_or_question"
        ],
        "value": "To address the gap between conventional experimental models and the complex, dynamic reality of human tumor microenvironments, specifically regarding how gut microbiota influence cancer progression, immune response, and therapeutic efficacy. The review aims to evaluate the utility of organoids in capturing these interactions and identify remaining bottlenecks in translating these findings to precision medicine.",
